:: Deadwood Remy Locket Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-remy-text'>>
  <<set _remy_locket to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
  <<switch _args[0]>>
    <<case 'intro'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Remy lays a pencil across the lesson register. "Something else?" You open the locket in your palm. <<He>> looks down without reaching for it.
          <br><br>
          <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy'>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              "There I am." <<His>> smile settles into place. "Something to remind you where to come back to." Your thumb rests against the catch; the locket stays in your hand.
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              Remy recognises the photograph. "You kept it." <<He>> straightens the pencil before looking at you again. "Is there something you meant to say?"
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              <<if C.npc.Remy.love lte $npclovelow>>"A photograph has rather fewer demands on its time." <<He>> glances towards the yard. "Was that all?"<<elseif _locket_familiar>>"Still there?" Remy looks pleased despite the question. "The real one is standing in front of you."<<else>>"Well." <<He>> looks from the photograph to your face. "That explains why you wanted my attention." The pencil rolls under <<his>> fingers, then stops.<</if>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>You tell <<him>> you wanted <<him>> to see whose picture you carry.<<else>>You hold it steady while <<he>> looks. <<He>> waits to see whether you will explain.<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              "You've found another reason to come looking for me." <<He>> lets the remark hang. <<if _locket_selected>>You say that the photograph was an excuse to speak to <<him>>. "Then speak."<<else>><<He>> does not touch the photograph. "A souvenir, or something you wanted to ask?"<</if>>
            <<else>>
              "Where did you get that?" Remy's polite expression holds while <<he>> waits. <<if _locket_selected>>You explain that you wanted a picture of <<him>>. "I see. And you came to tell me that yourself."<<else>>You explain how it came into your hands. <<He>> checks the yard before returning <<his>> attention to you.<</if>>
            <</if>>
          <<elseif _locket_photo>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              Remy studies the face inside. "Someone you're waiting for?" <<He>> watches you rather than the photograph as you draw the chain back across your palm.
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              "Someone else." <<He>> says it without asking who. "Then I trust you didn't come to discuss our old arrangement."
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>"You wanted me to see this?" <<His>> smile thins. You can close the locket, or explain why you opened it.<<else>>"You make room for quite a few people." <<He>> folds <<his>> hands on the register. "Was there a reason for showing me?"<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>You begin to explain that you came to see <<him>>. Remy looks up from the photograph. "Then tell me what you came for."<<else>>"I see." <<He>> leaves the spare chair where it is. "And what brings you here today?"<</if>>
            <<else>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>You say you had hoped to talk about something more personal. <<He>> looks at the open locket once more. "You'll have to be a little clearer."<<else>>"Someone worth keeping close, apparently." <<He>> gives the picture a brief, courteous glance, then waits for your question.<</if>>
            <</if>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Alex' and _remy_locket.farmConflict>>
              <br><br>"Alex." Remy's eyes return to the picture. "If you've come to ask about the farm, say so." The lesson register stays closed beneath <<his>> hand.
            <</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              Remy looks into the empty frame. "You ought to know what belongs there." <<He>> waits, leaving you to hold the little case open.
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              <<He>> looks at the empty space, then at you. "I'm not going to guess what that means." <<His>> voice is as level as when <<he>> asks about a lesson.
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              "Empty." <<He>> raises an eyebrow. <<if _locket_selected>>You say you were thinking about what to put inside. "Then you can tell me what you have in mind."<<else>>"Saves making a decision, I suppose." <<He>> waits to see whether you will answer.<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              "Still deciding?" <<if _locket_selected>>You tell <<him>> you had hoped to ask about a photograph. "Mine?" <<He>> makes you answer before saying anything more.<<else>><<He>> watches you turn the empty case towards the light. "You needn't ask my permission."<</if>>
            <<else>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>You begin to explain why you brought the empty locket to <<him>>. "If you have a question, ask it," <<he>> says.<<else>>Remy glances at the catch. "Make sure it fastens. You don't want the chain caught in a rein." <<He>> points to it, leaving the locket in your palm.<</if>>
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
          <<if $remy_mask and ['saved', 'fallen', 'kicked'].includes($avery_fate)>>
            <br><br>You tilt the case to catch the light. Remy turns the masked side of <<his>> face away from its polished lid. "I can see it perfectly well."
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          雷米把铅笔横放在课程登记簿上。“还有事？”你在掌心里打开吊坠。<<He>>垂眼看去，没有伸手来拿。
          <br><br>
          <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy'>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              “原来在这里。”<<His>>脸上浮起笑容。“提醒你，该回哪里去。”你的拇指抵着扣件，吊坠仍握在自己手中。
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              雷米认出了照片。“你还留着。”<<He>>把铅笔摆正，才又看向你。“有什么想说的吗？”
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              <<if C.npc.Remy.love lte $npclovelow>>“照片倒是用不着安排时间。”<<He>>瞥向庭院。“就为这个？”<<elseif _locket_familiar>>“还在里面？”雷米虽然这样问，看起来却很满意。“真人就在你面前。”<<else>>“哦。”<<He>>看看照片，再看看你的脸。“难怪非要让我看。”铅笔在<<his>>指间滚了半圈，停下来。<</if>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>你告诉<<him>>，想让<<he>>看看自己随身带着谁的照片。<<else>>你把吊坠拿稳，给<<him>>看清楚。<<He>>等着，看你会不会解释。<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              “又找到一个来找我的理由了。”<<He>>留了点时间，让你接话。<<if _locket_selected>>你说，照片只是找<<him>>说话的借口。“那就说吧。”<<else>><<He>>没有碰照片。“留作纪念，还是有什么想问的？”<</if>>
            <<else>>
              “从哪里弄来的？”雷米维持着客气的表情，等你回答。<<if _locket_selected>>你说明，自己想留一张<<his>>照片。“是吗。还特地亲自来告诉我。”<<else>>你解释了照片的来处。<<He>>看了眼庭院，才又把注意力转回你身上。<</if>>
            <</if>>
          <<elseif _locket_photo>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              雷米端详着照片里的人。“等着谁来找你？”你把链子收回掌心时，<<he>>看的却是你，没有再看照片。
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              “换人了。”<<He>>没问那是谁。“那么，你应该不是来谈从前的约定。”
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>“你特意拿给我看这个？”<<His>>笑容淡下来。你可以合上吊坠，也可以解释为什么打开它。<<else>>“你倒是给不少人留了位置。”<<He>>把双手交叠在登记簿上。“拿给我看，是有什么用意吗？”<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>你刚想解释自己是来找<<him>>，雷米就从照片上抬起目光。“那就告诉我，你来做什么。”<<else>>“原来如此。”<<He>>没有挪动那张空椅子。“那么，今天为什么过来？”<</if>>
            <<else>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>你说，想跟<<him>>谈些私人的事。<<He>>又看了一眼敞开的吊坠。“你得说得再清楚一点。”<<else>>“看来，是值得随身带着的人。”<<He>>客气地看了一眼照片，等你提出问题。<</if>>
            <</if>>
            <<if _locket_photo is 'Alex' and _remy_locket.farmConflict>>
              <br><br>“艾利克斯。”雷米又看向照片。“为了农场来的，就直说。”<<His>>手下，课程登记簿仍合着。
            <</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
              雷米看着空相框。“你该知道，这里该放谁。”<<He>>等着，由你继续托着敞开的小盒子。
            <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
              <<He>>看了看空位，又看向你。“我不打算猜这是什么意思。”<<His>>语气平得像在询问一堂课。
            <<elseif _locket_formal>>
              “空着。”<<He>>扬起眉毛。<<if _locket_selected>>你说，自己在想该放什么进去。“那就说说，你是怎么想的。”<<else>>“倒是省得作决定了。”<<He>>等着看你会不会回答。<</if>>
            <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
              “还没决定？”<<if _locket_selected>>你告诉<<him>>，自己想问问照片的事。“我的？”<<He>>等你回答，没有继续往下说。<<else>><<He>>看着你把空吊坠转向亮处。“用不着征求我的同意。”<</if>>
            <<else>>
              <<if _locket_selected>>你开始解释，为什么把空吊坠拿到<<his>>面前。“有问题就问。”<<He>>说。<<else>>雷米瞥了眼扣件。“扣紧一点。别让链子挂上缰绳。”<<He>>指了指，吊坠仍在你掌中。<</if>>
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
          <<if $remy_mask and ['saved', 'fallen', 'kicked'].includes($avery_fate)>>
            <br><br>你把吊坠转向亮处，雷米将戴着面具的半张脸偏离光亮的盒盖。“我看得清楚。”
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'affection'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You tell Remy that you like having <<him>> with you, even when you cannot come to the school.
          <<if C.npc.Remy.love lte $npclovelow>>
            "A picture is easy enough to please." <<He>> looks at you over the register. "People take a little more trouble."
          <<else>>
            <<He>> looks down at the photograph once more. "It won't tell you when I'm free." You ask <<him>> to tell you <<himself>>.
            <<if _remy_locket.stage is 'close'>>
              "You could ask me now." <<He>> leaves the register shut and offers <<his>> hand across it.
            <<else>>
              "Before the next group arrives, perhaps." <<His>> gloved fingers settle beside your hand, waiting for you to move closer.
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你告诉雷米，即使没空来学校，也喜欢把<<him>>带在身边。
          <<if C.npc.Remy.love lte $npclovelow>>
            “照片倒是很好哄。”<<He>>隔着登记簿看你。“跟真人相处，得多费点心。”
          <<else>>
            <<He>>又看了一次照片。“它可不会告诉你，我什么时候有空。”你让<<him>>亲自告诉你。
            <<if _remy_locket.stage is 'close'>>
              “现在就可以问。”<<He>>没有翻开登记簿，隔着它向你伸出手。
            <<else>>
              “不妨赶在下一批学员过来之前。”<<His>>戴着手套的手指停在你的手边，等你靠近。
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'explain'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy'>>
            You explain why you kept this particular photograph. <<if _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>"A photograph can stay where it is," Remy says. "That doesn't settle anything between us." You close your fingers around the case.<<elseif _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>"You remembered." <<He>> sounds satisfied before you have finished. You finish anyway, keeping the locket in your own hand.<<elseif _locket_familiar>>"Yes, I remember." <<He>> looks at your face as you explain what the picture means to you now. This time <<he>> lets you finish.<<else>>Remy listens, then examines the picture again. "You could have chosen a worse one." <<He>> straightens <<his>> glove at the wrist.<</if>>
          <<elseif _locket_photo>>
            You tell Remy what the photograph means to you. <<if _locket_photo is 'Alex' and _remy_locket.farmConflict>>"I know who Alex is." <<He>> taps the register once. You finish your explanation without asking <<him>> to agree about the farm.<<elseif _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>"You seem to have thought about them a great deal." <<He>> waits until you bring the case back towards yourself.<<elseif _locket_formal>>"And you wanted me to know." <<He>> looks at you for a moment. "Very well. I've heard you."<<else>>"A keepsake, then." <<He>> does not ask to handle it. You draw the chain back through your fingers.<</if>>
          <<else>>
            You explain that you are still deciding whether to put a photograph inside. <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>"I would have thought the choice was obvious." <<He>> watches the empty frame. You let the lid rest against your thumb.<<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>"Then decide when you know." <<He>> leaves it at that.<<elseif _locket_formal>>"If you want something from me, you can ask." You tell <<him>> you are considering it; you have not asked yet. <<He>> gives a short, impatient laugh. "So I gather."<<else>>"It will keep." Remy glances at the clock. "You don't have to decide before the next lesson."<</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _locket_photo is 'Remy'>>
            你解释了为什么留下这张照片。<<if _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>“照片可以留着。”雷米说。“可我们之间的事，不能靠它决定。”你拢起手指，握住小盒子。<<elseif _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>“你记得。”你还没讲完，<<he>>就已经很满意了。你仍把话讲完，吊坠一直握在自己手中。<<elseif _locket_familiar>>“嗯，我记得。”你说起如今再看这张照片时的想法，<<he>>看的却是你的脸。这次，<<he>>等你说完了。<<else>>雷米听完，又端详一次照片。“还不算选得太差。”<<He>>拉平了腕口的手套。<</if>>
          <<elseif _locket_photo>>
            你告诉雷米，这张照片对自己意味着什么。<<if _locket_photo is 'Alex' and _remy_locket.farmConflict>>“我知道艾利克斯是谁。”<<He>>敲了一下登记簿。你把自己的话说完，没有请<<he>>赞同你对农场的看法。<<elseif _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>“看来，你没少想着这个人。”<<He>>等到你把吊坠收回身前。<<elseif _locket_formal>>“所以，想让我知道。”<<He>>看了你一会儿。“好，我听见了。”<<else>>“留作纪念。”<<He>>没有要求拿起来看。你把链子一点点收回指间。<</if>>
          <<else>>
            你解释，自己还在考虑要不要放张照片进去。<<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>“我还以为，这很好选。”<<He>>看着空相框。你让盒盖抵着自己的拇指。<<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>“想好了再决定。”<<He>>没有多说。<<elseif _locket_formal>>“想找我要什么，可以开口。”你说自己还在考虑，还没有开口要。<<He>>短促地笑了一声，带点不耐烦。“看出来了。”<<else>>“它又不会跑。”雷米瞥了眼钟。“不必赶在下一节课之前决定。”<</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'reassure'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You tell Remy that you came to see <<him>> today.
          <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
            "I can see that." <<His>> gaze stays on you as you bring the locket back to your chest. "You found your way here."
          <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
            "We can have a conversation." <<He>> draws the spare chair out a little. "Let's be clear about which conversation we're having."
          <<elseif _locket_formal>>
            Remy looks towards the waiting pupils, then back at you. "Then give me a moment of your attention." You let the case rest in your palm while you speak. <<He>> leaves the photograph alone.
          <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
            "So you said." <<He>> moves the register away from the edge of the desk. "You can tell me what you had in mind."
          <<else>>
            "Then I'm listening." <<He>> keeps the register beside <<him>>, waiting for you to say more.
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你告诉雷米，今天是来见<<him>>。
          <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>
            “看得出来。”你把吊坠收回胸前时，<<his>>目光仍留在你身上。“你知道怎么找到这里。”
          <<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>
            “谈话当然可以。”<<He>>把空椅子拉出来一点。“先说清楚，我们要谈什么。”
          <<elseif _locket_formal>>
            雷米望向等候的学员，又转回你这里。“那么，分点注意力给我。”你托着小盒子，继续说话。<<He>>没有碰里面的照片。
          <<elseif _remy_locket.stage is 'courting'>>
            “听见了。”<<He>>把登记簿从桌沿挪开。“可以说说，你有什么打算。”
          <<else>>
            “那我听着。”<<He>>将登记簿留在身旁，等你继续开口。
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<case 'private'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You close the locket and settle the chain yourself. <<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>Remy's eyes follow your hand back to the chain. "Finished?"<<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>Remy leaves the subject where you put it. "Anything about the school?"<<elseif _locket_formal>>"Keeping the rest to yourself?" <<He>> watches you for a moment, then picks up the pencil.<<else>>"Very well." <<He>> picks up the register.<</if>> An instructor calls from the yard. Remy turns to answer, leaving your hand on the closed case.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你合上吊坠，自己理好链子。<<if _remy_locket.state.syndrome>>雷米的目光随着你的手落到链子上。“说完了？”<<elseif _remy_locket.state.ended and !_locket_formal>>雷米没有接着追问。“学校的事，还有什么要问吗？”<<elseif _locket_formal>>“剩下的留给自己？”<<He>>看了你一会儿，才拿起铅笔。<<else>>“好吧。”<<He>>拿起登记簿。<</if>> 庭院里的教练叫了<<him>>一声。雷米转头回应，你的手仍按在合上的小盒子上。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-locket-remy-memory'>>
  <<set _remy_locket_memory to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
  <<if !_remy_locket_memory?.state.romance or _remy_locket_memory.state.ended or _remy_locket_memory.state.syndrome or _remy_locket_memory.confined or !isLoveInterest('Remy')>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<set _remy_locket_record to $DeadwoodReblooms?.locket?.Remy>>
  <<if !_remy_locket_record or _remy_locket_record.photo isnot 'Remy' or !_remy_locket_record.choice>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if !['rest', 'tack', 'rota', 'relationship'].includes(_args[0])>><<exit>><</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'rest'>>
          Remy catches your eye and taps the desk. "That photograph of yours doesn't have to answer when you look at it." You ask whether <<he>> would prefer you brought it out instead. "I didn't say that." <<He>> leaves the pencil where it is.
        <<case 'tack'>>
          Remy wipes a buckle before handing it to you. "I trust you keep that photograph of me rather cleaner than this." You ask whether <<he>> means to inspect it. "I can see how you look after the leather first." <<He>> puts the cloth within your reach.
        <<case 'rota'>>
          Remy points to the blank space between two lessons. "Your photograph won't tell you about that one." <<He>> turns the page towards you. "Ask me while I'm here."
        <<case 'relationship'>>
          "You brought my photograph to show me." Remy taps the timetable. "If you want time with the original, we'd better look at this." <<He>> waits for your answer before returning to the times on the page.
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch _args[0]>>
        <<case 'rest'>>
          雷米迎上你的视线，敲了敲桌子。“你看照片，它可用不着回答。”你问，难道<<he>>更愿意让你把照片拿出来看。“我可没这样说。”<<He>>没有去拿铅笔。
        <<case 'tack'>>
          雷米擦过扣件，才递给你。“希望你把我的照片收拾得比这个干净些。”你问，难道<<he>>还要检查。“可以先看看，你怎么打理皮革。”<<He>>把布放在你伸手可及的地方。
        <<case 'rota'>>
          雷米指向两节课之间的空档。“你的照片可不会告诉你这个。”<<He>>把纸页转向你。“人就在这里，可以直接问。”
        <<case 'relationship'>>
          “你把我的照片拿给我看过。”雷米敲了敲时间表。“想找真人相处，我们最好看看这个。”<<He>>等你回答，才又看向纸页上的时间。
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>
